{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42202","headline":"王三十七自京垂访作此送之 · 徐铉","name":"王三十七自京垂访作此送之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"失乡迁客在天涯，门掩苔垣向水斜。\n只就鳞鸿求远信，敢言车马访贫家。\n烟生柳岸将垂缕，雪压梅园半是花。\n惆怅明朝尊酒散，梦魂相送到京华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}